   FAIL  Tests\Feature\ContextSecurityTest
  ⨯ it rechecks trusted provenance after late creating observers
  ⨯ it guards direct association writes against cross-scope and foreign connection input
  ⨯ it rejects a late observer changing association endpoints
  ⨯ it rejects malformed actor identities and foreign profile IDs
  ⨯ it rejects direct foreign workspace writes and foreign connection queries
  ⨯ it treats observer veto as failed mutation without dispatching success events
  ⨯ it overwrites forged creation provenance and prevents changing it afterward
  ⨯ it fails closed for disabled CRM and tenant context mismatch
  ⨯ it rejects a late observer changing the workspace and guards quiet writes
  ⨯ it requires account-level capability when no workspace exists

   FAIL  Tests\Feature\SalesStorageTest
  ⨯ it refuses conversion without explicit human identity and preserves the lead
  ⨯ it stores activity kinds and canonical target associations
  ⨯ it rolls back the entire conversion when the final lead update is vetoed
