  ⨯ it rejects creation veto without persisted rows or success events
  ⨯ it persists canonical lead fields with trusted provenance

   FAIL  Tests\Feature\ActivityTimelineTest
  ⨯ it logs a polymorphic activity resolved through the morph alias
  ⨯ it attaches activities to different subject types

   FAIL  Tests\Feature\ApiOperationsTest
  ⨯ it declares and dispatches company, contact and association operations through the platform boundary
  ⨯ it preserves string CRM identifiers and rejects non-string input

   FAIL  Tests\Feature\RegistryFieldCastsTest
  ⨯ it compiles a consumer money field using the intl cast registration

   FAIL  Tests\Feature\DealFlowTest
  ⨯ it moves a deal to a won stage and marks it won
  ⨯ it creates a deal at the first stage with money
  ⨯ it rolls back a vetoed stage update without a success event
  ⨯ it rejects a stage from another pipeline without changing the deal or emitting an event
  ⨯ it refuses to create a deal in a pipeline without stages
  ⨯ it clears optional amount without clearing mandatory currency

   FAIL  Tests\Feature\CompanyContactTest
  ⨯ it creates a company and a contact linked to it

   FAIL  Tests\Feature\LeadConversionTest
  ⨯ it returns the same conversion on retry even when passed a stale lead instance
  ⨯ it converts a lead without company or deal
  ⨯ it converts a lead into contact, company and deal
